# Cloudflare redirects. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>
#
# Workers static assets only accepts RELATIVE urls, in both the source and the
# destination. An absolute url fails the whole deploy with
# "Only relative URLs are allowed [code: 100324]".
#
# So www -> apex is not done here — set it up as a Redirect Rule in the
# dashboard, or attach only the apex as a custom domain. External shortlinks
# (/gh, /li) are not possible here either.

# Friendly short paths.
/blog/*      /writing/:splat   301
/posts/*     /writing/:splat   301
/rss         /feed.xml         301
